  "invariants": [
    "NativeUI uses the existing ordinary NSBrowser/NSMatrix/NSScrollView. No control algorithm or native provider/loader ABI change; shared API remains 1/584.",
    "Operation 50 retains its part-6 rectangle and adds existing native state/selection from one UI dispatch. Bootstrap part 2.y advertises paired geometry. The unchanged compiled old consumer is tested.",
    "One guarded scroll-container hook serves native text and lists. Original Gecko scroll/reveal/set-rectangle methods retain layout bookkeeping and trusted events. Native UI supplies clip, document, row bounds, wheel and selection.",
    "Original GetFramesForArea runs first. Original TransformPoint handles Layout/Visual viewport conversion; original nsTArray InsertSlotsAt preserves storage relocation and traversal ordering. Shared native point hits supply live semantic row IDs without copied UI algorithms or raw GC stores.",
    "Root/control/frame identities are rechecked after RPC. Retired owners/rows clear weak results. Original overlays, pointer/default cancellation and event construction remain engine-owned.",
    "Native wheel regions include descendants through the original nearest scroll owner, preserving native defaults on pages without DOM wheel handlers.",
    "Only small isolated adapters and metadata test probes are compiled. Browser, AppKit, backend and shared UI binaries are unchanged. Toolbars, address bars and tabs stay original; future optional patches stay above the common layer reused by GTK/Qt/KDE."
  ]
